  "details": "Having a Unity UI element (such as a Button or Toggle) with an event that triggers \"No Function\" (does nothing) triggers the VRChat Event Filter with the message `Events on 'GameObject' were removed because one of them targeted a prohibited type 'GameObject', method '' or object 'Object'.`\n\nSteps to recreate:\n\nSet up a world scene\n\nRight click in the hierarchy and click \"UI->Button\" to create a new button\n\nGo to the button component and add a new event and drop any GameObject in the Object slot\n\nEnter playmode, a warning is printed out to the console from the `UnityEventFilter` script",
